{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34204","headline":"江南曲 · 陆龟蒙","name":"江南曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲爱江南春，涉江聊采苹。\n水深烟浩浩，空对双车轮。\n车轮明月团，车盖浮云盘。\n云月徒自好，水中行路难。\n遥遥洛阳道，夹道生春草。\n寄语櫂船郎，莫夸风浪好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}